            0.118,
            0.121,
            0.239,
            0.138
          ],
          "content": "**Figure it Out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.138,
            0.883,
            0.173
          ],
          "content": "**Q.1. There is only one supercell (number greater than all its neighbours) in this grid. If you**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.174,
            0.881,
            0.208
          ],
          "content": "**exchange two digits of one of the numbers, there will be 4 supercells. Figure out which digits to swap.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.215,
            0.208,
            0.54,
            0.278
          ],
          "content": "| 16,200 | 39,344 | 29,765 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 23,609 | 62,871 | 45,306 |\n| 19,381 | 50,319 | 38,408 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_30_table_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.296,
            0.871,
            0.315
          ],
          "content": "Ans. If I exchange the digits 1 and 6 in the number 62,871 then there will be 4 Super cells."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.215,
            0.329,
            0.541,
            0.401
          ],
          "content": "| 16,200 | 39,344 | 29,765 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 23,609 | 12,876 | 45,306 |\n| 19,381 | 50,319 | 38,408 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_30_table_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.419,
            0.851,
            0.454
          ],
          "content": "**Q.2. How many rounds does your year of birth take to reach the Kaprekar constant?** Ans. Suppose the birth year is 1980, then, -"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.22,
            0.453,
            0.838,
            0.505
          ],
          "content": "| 9810 | 8721 | 7443 | 9963 | 6642 | 7641 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| -1089 | -1278 | -3447 | -3699 | -2466 | -1467 |\n| 8721 | 7443 | 3996 | 6264 | 4176 | 6174 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.522,
                0.591,
                0.54
              ],
              "content": "It takes 6 rounds. (Try now for your year of birth.)"
            }
          ],
          "image_source": "images/page_30_table_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.556,
            0.882,
            0.611
          ],
          "content": "**Q.3. We are the group of 5-digit numbers between 35,000 and 75,000 such that all of our digits are odd. Who is the largest number in our group? Who is the smallest number in our group? Who among us is the closest to 50,000?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.611,
            0.161,
            0.626
          ],
          "content": "Ans."
        },
        {
